+		vl_reply("ping | stat | peek PA [WORDS] | poke PA VALUE | pmic ADDR [N] | i2c DEV REG N | i2cw DEV REG B.. | i2c8[w] BUS DEV REG N|B.. | bat [poll|lpm on|off] | wifi [status|detect|on|wmt|fw|cap|off] | cpu [status|gov on|off|set|max ll|big|cci MHz|fast on|off] | gpu [status|mfg|on|off|regs|freq [MHz]|selftest [fault]|probe|publish] | disp [regs|scanout on|off] | push SIZE MODE FNV PATH | pull PATH | run ARGS.. | vivad ps|kill ID|tests | ps [NAME|PID] | kill PID [SIG] | rewind [BYTES] | console [on|off] | panic [TEXT] | reboot\n");
